            "title": "A股半日收升  深股創板大漲",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">上證指數上午收報3486點，漲0.28%或9 點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深證成指上午收報10301點，漲2.16%或217點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">創業板指上午收報2272點，漲3.79%或82點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬深300上午收報3909點，漲0.24%或9點。</p>\n</div>",
