        {
            "title": "港股開升36點   神華跌近2.4%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股恒生指數開升36點或0.17%，報22,263 ; 恒生科技指數開升16點或0.47%，報3,433 ; 恒生國企指數開升7點或0.11%，報7,501，大市成交17.35億元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：中國神華官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2023/08/20230823_FI_source-web_中國神華704.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：中國神華官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2023/08/20230823_FI_source-web_中國神華704.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：中國神華官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">中國神華(01088)跌2.37%，報40.3元，折讓7.7%配股集資逾67億元償還境內債務。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">小米(01810)回落1.13%，至26.3元。聯想(00992)升2.92%，報17.28元 ; 寧德時代(03750)彈2.36%，報304元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">騰訊(00700)跌0.29%，報340元成交居首。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">日照港裕廊(06117)升14.42%，報0.595元，成交居第三位。上午09:00出現大手買入，成交量為1.52千萬，成交價為0.545元，涉資828.4萬。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17272294-%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1%e9%96%8b%e5%8d%8736%e9%bb%9e-%e7%a5%9e%e8%8f%af%e8%b7%8c%e8%bf%912-4",
